<page type="text" lines="ocr">
  <layout>One page of text in a single column of italic verse; margin note at lower right, beside the last lines.</layout>
  <page_number>84</page_number>
  <running_head>VARIA POEMATA.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">
      <i>Seu cum decoro fquallidum te puluere</i>
    </l>
    <l n="2">
      <i>Mirata quondam eft Rufcino</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>Solum feroces bellicofa libera</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4">
      <i>Parma morantem exercitus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>Tunc cum tuorum fida caftrorum comes</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Attonita virtus par nouum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7">
      <i>Spectauit, hinc virum, inde bellum, &amp;</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>horruit Quod fecerat fpectaculum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Vercella pectus una follicitat meum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Vercella fola macerat,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>Vercella vita Gallijs dum vincitur</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Felicior victricibus.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Virtute tanta comminus cui perfrui</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Indulsit Astrorum fauor.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>Inusitato quam theatrum calites</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Elegerint spectaculo:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Cum te chorago pace cum placida feram</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Mars copulauit dexteram:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>Bellona mitis frena legum pertulit,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20">
      <i>Innoxioq; fœdere</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>Vis æquitati iuncta, ius licentiæ</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>Secura pressit compita,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23">
      <i>Saluoque recti &amp; improbi discrimine</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Castris forum se miscuit.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Quem nuper inter arma fossarum mora,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26">
      <i>Celsaque pinnarum mina,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27">
      <i>Tot stricta tela, plumbeaq; grandinis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28">
      <i>Procella non exterruit,</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <marginalia>
    <note side="right" at="Quem nuper inter" line_from="25" line_to="25">Idem</note>
  </marginalia>
  <notes>Lines of the first stanza with "Quod fecerat" and the line "Quem" are underlined in the print. A decorative sign stands before "Astrorum" and before "Mars". "vita" (stanza 2) is doubtful: the print reads "viEta" or similar, [?] not marked on the word because the sense is clear. "stricta" and "mina" are doubtful readings. "Gallijs" is copied as printed. The "Idem" note is a marginal note beside the last line.</notes>
</page>
